  "analysis": "Excellent! The dubbing process completed successfully. The audio has been generated with proper LUFS normalization (-23.0 LUFS), converted to 48kHz mono, and the timing is very close (drift of -0.014s, well within the 0.2s requirement, and start offset is 0ms, well within the 10ms requirement). Now I need to verify all the outputs are correct.",
  "plan": "Verify that all three required outputs exist and meet the specifications: 1) Check seg_0.wav exists and has correct properties, 2) Check dubbed.mp4 exists and has correct audio specs, 3) Check report.json exists and has correct format.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -lh /outputs/\n",
      "duration": 0.1
